  "prefLabel": "Rev 903.09 Deductions for Trust Beneficiary Income",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 903.09 Deductions for Trust Beneficiary Income. Deductions used in the computation of distributive gross income to trust beneficiaries shall not be added back when calculating the portion of the distribution subject to tax under RSA 77.\n\nSource. #10795, eff 3-11-15; ss by #13443, eff 8-12-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev900.html"
